   "tags": "Technical • ELECTRONICS ENGINEERING • +1 / -0",
   "html": "<p>In the given circuit, diodes <em>D</em><sub>1</sub> and <em>D</em><sub>2</sub> are ideal and <em>V<sub>i</sub></em>(<em>t</em>) = 9 sin (ω<em>t</em>) volt.</p>\n\n<div> </div>\n\n<div><img alt=\"\" src=\"media/15/15b2f351cb8f6e5daf45.png\" /></div>\n\n<div> </div>\n\n<div>The average steady-state voltage across diode <em>D</em><sub>2</sub> (with polarity as mentioned) is _________ volt.<br />\n(Rounded upto nearest integer)</div>",
